{"content_hash": "7d676482cf1dd59b", "version_id": 833, "article_id": 84, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "The Weeknd samples Faye Wong's 1993 song on Hong Kong tour", "title_zh": "The Weeknd香港开唱，采样了王菲1993年的老歌", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8188417.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596633313465-1256feb1c6d9?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8d2Vla25kfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM0OTIzMjJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Samuel Regan-Asante on Unsplash", "author": "Samuel Regan-Asante", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@reganography?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/black-wooden-shelf-with-books-5j7nQv-jaVM?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(73, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(111, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "5d19934133bc"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-01", "word_count": 213, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "The Weeknd surprised fans in Hong Kong by sampling Faye Wong's 1993 Cantonese song 'Seasonal Wind' in a new tour track. The moment reminded people how far Wong's music has travelled beyond Asia.", "lead_zh": "The Weeknd在香港演唱会上给歌迷带来惊喜，在新歌里采样了王菲1993年的粤语歌《季候风》。这一刻也让人们再次看到，王菲的音乐早已走出亚洲。", "preview": "On 24 October, The Weeknd opened his Hong Kong shows with a city-only song called 'Hong Kong'. Between dark R&B beats, Faye Wong's calm Cant", "preview_zh": "10月24日，The Weeknd在香港站首场演出中，用一首只属于香港的歌《Hong Kong》开场。在暗色调的R&B节奏之间，王菲平静的粤语歌声突然响起，因为他采样了她1993年的《季候风》。新旧声音的混合效果比任何人预想的都好。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 816, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/84/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 84.275, "size_bytes": 506592, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/84/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 87.175, "size_bytes": 524016, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/84/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/84/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 92.975, "size_bytes": 558864, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/84/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/84/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 79.35, "size_bytes": 477072, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/84/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/84/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 84.55, "size_bytes": 508320, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/84/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@48085d2/content/data/versions/833.json", "paragraphs": ["On 24 October, The Weeknd opened his Hong Kong shows with a city-only song called 'Hong Kong'. Between dark R&B beats, Faye Wong's calm Cantonese voice suddenly appeared, because he had sampled her 1993 track 'Seasonal Wind'. The mix of old and new sounds worked better than anyone expected.", "This was not his first local experiment. In September he used a sample of a famous Japanese anime song for his Tokyo shows, and he did similar things in Canada and Brazil. The Weeknd is a big fan of late 1980s Hong Kong cinema, although his own taste alone cannot explain the choice.", "Wong never chased Western markets like some C-pop stars, but her numbers are still strong. She has about 1.42 million monthly listeners on Spotify and 3.17 million on YouTube Music. In 1999 she became the first Chinese singer to hold a solo concert at Tokyo's Budokan, and her Final Fantasy song reached number 9 on Japan's Oricon chart.", "In Europe and the US, her fame came mostly through film and indie music. Wong's role in Wong Kar-wai's 1994 film 'Chungking Express' won her many foreign fans. Later, British band Cocteau Twins invited her to sing with them, so she reached dream-pop listeners directly. Critics still praise her experimental 1996 album 'Fuzao'."], "paragraphs_zh": ["10月24日，The Weeknd在香港站首场演出中，用一首只属于香港的歌《Hong Kong》开场。在暗色调的R&B节奏之间，王菲平静的粤语歌声突然响起，因为他采样了她1993年的《季候风》。新旧声音的混合效果比任何人预想的都好。", "这不是他第一次做本地化尝试。9月他在东京演出时采样了一首著名日本动漫歌曲，在加拿大和巴西也做过类似创作。The Weeknd是80年代末香港电影的超级影迷，不过仅凭个人喜好并不能解释这次选择。", "王菲没有像一些C-pop歌手那样经营欧美市场，但她的数据依然亮眼。她在Spotify月听众约142万，在YouTube Music约317万。1999年，她成为首位在东京武道馆举办个人演唱会的华语歌手，她演唱的《最终幻想》主题曲登上日本Oricon榜第9位。", "在欧美，她的名气主要来自电影和独立音乐。王菲在王家卫1994年电影《重庆森林》中的角色为她赢得了许多海外粉丝。后来英国乐队Cocteau Twins主动邀请她合唱，让她直接接触到梦幻流行听众。乐评人至今仍称赞她1996年的实验专辑《浮躁》。"], "body": "On 24 October, The Weeknd opened his Hong Kong shows with a city-only song called 'Hong Kong'. Between dark R&B beats, Faye Wong's calm Cantonese voice suddenly appeared, because he had sampled her 1993 track 'Seasonal Wind'. The mix of old and new sounds worked better than anyone expected.\n\nThis was not his first local experiment. In September he used a sample of a famous Japanese anime song for his Tokyo shows, and he did similar things in Canada and Brazil. The Weeknd is a big fan of late 1980s Hong Kong cinema, although his own taste alone cannot explain the choice.\n\nWong never chased Western markets like some C-pop stars, but her numbers are still strong. She has about 1.42 million monthly listeners on Spotify and 3.17 million on YouTube Music. In 1999 she became the first Chinese singer to hold a solo concert at Tokyo's Budokan, and her Final Fantasy song reached number 9 on Japan's Oricon chart.\n\nIn Europe and the US, her fame came mostly through film and indie music. Wong's role in Wong Kar-wai's 1994 film 'Chungking Express' won her many foreign fans. Later, British band Cocteau Twins invited her to sing with them, so she reached dream-pop listeners directly. Critics still praise her experimental 1996 album 'Fuzao'.", "body_zh": "10月24日，The Weeknd在香港站首场演出中，用一首只属于香港的歌《Hong Kong》开场。在暗色调的R&B节奏之间，王菲平静的粤语歌声突然响起，因为他采样了她1993年的《季候风》。新旧声音的混合效果比任何人预想的都好。\n\n这不是他第一次做本地化尝试。9月他在东京演出时采样了一首著名日本动漫歌曲，在加拿大和巴西也做过类似创作。The Weeknd是80年代末香港电影的超级影迷，不过仅凭个人喜好并不能解释这次选择。\n\n王菲没有像一些C-pop歌手那样经营欧美市场，但她的数据依然亮眼。她在Spotify月听众约142万，在YouTube Music约317万。1999年，她成为首位在东京武道馆举办个人演唱会的华语歌手，她演唱的《最终幻想》主题曲登上日本Oricon榜第9位。\n\n在欧美，她的名气主要来自电影和独立音乐。王菲在王家卫1994年电影《重庆森林》中的角色为她赢得了许多海外粉丝。后来英国乐队Cocteau Twins主动邀请她合唱，让她直接接触到梦幻流行听众。乐评人至今仍称赞她1996年的实验专辑《浮躁》。", "text": "On 24 October, The Weeknd opened his Hong Kong shows with a city-only song called 'Hong Kong'. Between dark R&B beats, Faye Wong's calm Cantonese voice suddenly appeared, because he had sampled her 1993 track 'Seasonal Wind'. The mix of old and new sounds worked better than anyone expected. This was not his first local experiment. In September he used a sample of a famous Japanese anime song for his Tokyo shows, and he did similar things in Canada and Brazil. The Weeknd is a big fan of late 1980s Hong Kong cinema, although his own taste alone cannot explain the choice. Wong never chased Western markets like some C-pop stars, but her numbers are still strong. She has about 1.42 million monthly listeners on Spotify and 3.17 million on YouTube Music. In 1999 she became the first Chinese singer to hold a solo concert at Tokyo's Budokan, and her Final Fantasy song reached number 9 on Japan's Oricon chart. In Europe and the US, her fame came mostly through film and indie music. Wong's role in Wong Kar-wai's 1994 film 'Chungking Express' won her many foreign fans. Later, British band Cocteau Twins invited her to sing with them, so she reached dream-pop listeners directly. Critics still praise her experimental 1996 album 'Fuzao'.", "vocab": [{"word": "sample", "pos": "verb", "zh": "采样（音乐）", "note": "指在歌曲中截取并使用他人作品的片段", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tour", "pos": "noun", "zh": "巡演", "note": "常见搭配 on tour", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "experiment", "pos": "noun", "zh": "尝试；实验", "note": "此处指音乐上的新玩法", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "although", "pos": "conj", "zh": "尽管", "note": "引导让步状语从句", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "listener", "pos": "noun", "zh": "听众", "note": "流媒体平台上常用 monthly listeners", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "chart", "pos": "noun", "zh": "排行榜", "note": "如 Oricon chart", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "indie", "pos": "adj", "zh": "独立（音乐）的", "note": "indie music 指独立厂牌或非主流的音乐", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "praise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "称赞", "note": "常用 praise sb for sth", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "mainstream", "pos": "adj", "zh": "主流的", "note": "反义可记 underground", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "decade", "pos": "noun", "zh": "十年", "note": "复数 decades 表示几十年", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T00:18:40.801393", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "On", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "24", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.9, "sm": 375, "em": 900, "cs": 3, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "October", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.575, "sm": 900, "em": 1574, "cs": 6, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ",", "s": 1.575, "e": 1.675, "sm": 1575, "em": 1675, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "The", "s": 1.675, "e": 1.775, "sm": 1675, "em": 1774, "cs": 15, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Weeknd", "s": 1.775, "e": 2.125, "sm": 1775, "em": 2125, "cs": 19, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "opened", "s": 2.125, "e": 2.438, "sm": 2125, "em": 2437, "cs": 26, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "his", "s": 2.43